      "rdfs:comment": "Shape of the space this device holds material in, for the contained MaterialRepresentation to take over (see cpo:hasCavityForm). Carries no numbers of its own: every parameter is the very entity the body form uses in the opposite role, because the cavity's outer surface is the body's inner surface. The reason this property exists: the coolant fills the annular gap between the two shells (0.090 m to 0.096 m across, 0.216 m tall, 1.89e-4 m3), not the 1.73e-3 m3 cylinder that device:jacket001_Form describes. The bore in the middle, where the vessel sits, is not part of it.",
