      "rdfs:comment": "Cylinder from the outer dimensions: pi/4 x (0.01 m)^2 x 0.09 m = 0.000007068583 m3. That is the space the syringe takes up, not the amount of plastic in it - see material:syringe_template_Body_SolidPhase_Volume, which is about 40 % of this.",
