      "schema:name": "Glass volume times glass density",
      "schema:description": "Calculated from the assumed body volume (1.79e-4 m3) and the assumed glass density (2500 kg/m3): 1.79e-4 * 2500 = 0.45 kg. The vessel was never weighed - recalculate if either input changes.",
